#: ../../services.rst:2 39b8e18898de41d5b76526a600da9d6d
msgid "Services"
msgstr ""

#: ../../services.rst:4 ac8370bd3ee54c9182a003637fecccd1
msgid ""
"The service layer, ``apps/libraries/services``: one package per domain "
"role. The web views and the ``mhvtl`` command line call it directly; it "
"never sees a request and returns a ``ServiceResult`` from "
"``core.results``. Most of its modules open with the rules the layer "
"keeps, under *Rules for this layer*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../services.rst:11 0f30a8e09bba4a219c95018ab926c497
msgid "``services.core``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../services.rst:13 e7e6cd04a28f44179e2f3be29ef076b0
msgid ""
"Shared plumbing: results, shell execution, locking, retries, paths, "
"errors."
msgstr ""

#: ../../services.rst:16 ae330562512b4db1bbeca9ebd9b77ee3
msgid "``errors``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../services.rst:18 apps.libraries.services.core.errors:1
#: b3010dc8b8974f6eb9469309d13f33ec c71d8c75a32e4e61a5f706cb252aca67 of
msgid "Typed failures, so callers stop catching bare Exception."
msgstr ""

#: 7635406aea8643e1b813de878418a84c apps.libraries.services.core.errors:3 of
msgid ""
"New in the refactor. There are 103 bare `except Exception` blocks in the "
"current services and 124 in the views, which is how a missing method "
"(MHVTLLibraryService.add_drive) surfaced to the operator as \"Error:\" "
"for months instead of failing loudly."
msgstr ""

#: apps.libraries.services.core.errors:8 fc5c74d1da9643c593cc7e4db2bc74f0 of
msgid ""
"Services catch these, turn them into a failure ServiceResult and log "
"them; only genuinely unexpected errors propagate."
msgstr ""

