"typed, list-argument runner in iscsi_service.py:206. Replaces four "
"competing dialects, including console_service.py:133 - the only "
"shell=True in the codebase, which interpolated a caller-supplied log path"
" into a shell command."
msgstr ""

#: apps.libraries.services.core.shell:9 bcf58ca69cc94c6b864de7a94f3e917c of
msgid ""
"Timeouts were previously chosen per call site: 30 in 33 places, 10 in 18,"
" 5 in 11, 60 in 10, 600 in 2. They are named here instead, so \"how long "
"should mtx get\" is answered once."
msgstr ""

#: 145dcd89ee444b08b03f38a3b682e23c apps.libraries.services.core.shell.QUICK:1
#: of
msgid ""
"Named timeouts, in seconds. Anything slower than SLOW belongs in a "
"background job rather than a request: the gunicorn worker gives up at "
"120."
msgstr ""

#: 7e867ff0cd544e19b814542cc6d66bd9
#: apps.libraries.services.core.shell.CommandResult:1 of
