#: apps.libraries.services.config.device_conf.DeviceConf:3
#: d3908fd933a047e68295f3b3ca51d150 of
msgid ""
"libraries and drives are keyed by id and keep the order they appear in "
"the file - which is *not* sorted and *not* SCSI order. Never pair these "
"with lsscsi output by position; match on address()."
msgstr ""

