"Moved out of views.py:1152-1305, where the directory listing, os.stat "
"calls, the filename allowlist and the ZIP builder all lived inline in "
"three view methods - and where the allowlist was written out three times "
"and /etc/mhvtl hardcoded four times, ignoring settings.MHVTL_CONFIG_DIR."
