msgid ""
"Every write follows the same shape: take the directory lock, back up what"
" is there, write a temp file, fsync, rename. A reader sees the old file "
"or the new one, never a half-written device.conf - the difference between"
" a library that is briefly invisible and one the daemons refuse to start."
