"each id is the daemon's message queue id and the kernel minor number, and"
" both daemons refuse id >= MAXPRIOR (include/utils/q.h:50; "
"usr/cmd/vtllibrary.c:1610; usr/cmd/vtltape.c:2430, upstream 2416; "
"kernel/mhvtl.c:186 DEF_MAX_MINOR_NO)."
