#: 207f7924697844fba4cb505fa9201faf
#: apps.libraries.services.console.metrics.uptime:3 of
msgid ""
"None when systemd has no start time for it, which is the honest answer "
"for a unit that has never run. The version this replaces returned the "
"string \"Running\" in that case, so a stopped daemon's page said Running."
