#: f2dd06c8e864475eb4c75db6b8699056 of
msgid ""
"Share of memory in use, 0-100, from /proc/meminfo (MemTotal minus "
"MemAvailable). The console dashboard and its refresh endpoint read it; it"
" was missing, so the page showed 0% and the endpoint failed."
msgstr ""

