#: 0bc44b0e47f640f2a4d8a58ec9071a8c apps.libraries.services.iscsi.targetcli:23
#: of
msgid ""
"The old check was iqn.startswith('iqn.'), so 'iqn.' alone was accepted, "
"as was 'iqn.$(reboot)'. RFC 3720 shapes an IQN as"
