"A CHAP secret. 12 to 16 characters is what every initiator accepts (the "
"Microsoft one refuses anything else); no spaces, quotes or '=', which "
"targetcli's own command parser would split or strip."
msgstr ""

#: 1ed2445746ff4968934633a5def3bea7
#: apps.libraries.services.iscsi.targetcli.InvalidChap:1 of
msgid "A CHAP user name or secret that would not survive, or not be accepted."
msgstr ""

#: 7b9fe00eeb0e4b8b8a801812d1f32886
#: apps.libraries.services.iscsi.targetcli.InvalidIqn:1 of
